    "final_answer_text": "Here are the five products that should be reordered, as their stock on hand is below the reorder level, sorted by the largest shortage first:\n\n1. **Gorgonzola Telino**: 0 units in stock, reorder level 20, shortage of 20 units.\n2. **Louisiana Hot Spiced Okra**: 4 units in stock, reorder level 20, shortage of 16 units.\n3. **Mascarpone Fabioli**: 9 units in stock, reorder level 25, shortage of 16 units.\n4. **Outback Lager**: 15 units in stock, reorder level 30, shortage of 15 units.\n5. **Gravad lax**: 11 units in stock, reorder level 25, shortage of 14 units.",
    "sql_generated": [
      "SELECT product_name, units_in_stock, reorder_level, (reorder_level - units_in_stock) AS shortage\nFROM public.products\nWHERE units_in_stock < reorder_level\nORDER BY shortage DESC\nLIMIT 5;"
